      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested files, I need to use a concrete external provider for each scored implementation file. For the same-scenario files, I will use Azure Cosmos DB, which is a managed NoSQL document store provided by Microsoft. For the later-step files, I will use Azure services such as Azure Cognitive Services for text safety and translation, and Azure Blob Storage for archiving. The local helper files will provide configuration and utility functions to interact with Azure Cosmos DB. </thinking>\n",
